---
import Mark from '@/components/Mark.astro'
import SectionHead from '@/components/SectionHead.astro'
import { gifSrc } from '@/data/gifs'
import { profile } from '@/data/profile'
---

<section id="contact" class="sec contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <SectionHead
    num="05"
    title="SAY HI! (⁀ᗢ⁀)"
    cmd="nc -l 2048"
    id="contact-title"
  >
    <Mark variant="dots" left="82%" top="230px" speed={0.4} />
    <Mark variant="ruler" left="54%" top="360px" speed={-0.2} />
  </SectionHead>
  <div class="contact-body">
    <p>
      Well, I vaguely recall myself taking the{' '}
      <button
        class="linkish"
        type="button"
        data-open="pill"
        data-gif={gifSrc('pill')}
        aria-haspopup="dialog"
      >
        blue pill
      </button>
      . So, whoever designed Earth C-137, really did a great job of designing
      it. Respecting that, I really enjoy travelling and discovering natural
      beauties.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you wanna have coffee with me sometime feel free to message me on
      LinkedIn or shoot me an email.
    </p>
    <div class="contact-btns">
      <a
        class="btn solid"
        href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}
        data-ga="contact_click"
        data-ga-method="email"
        data-ga-location="contact"
      >
        {profile.email}
      </a>
      <a
        class="btn"
        href={profile.linkedin}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        data-ga="contact_click"
        data-ga-method="linkedin"
        data-ga-location="contact"
      >
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer class="mono site-foot">
    <span>© {profile.name} · assembled on Earth C-137</span>
    <span>{profile.email} · linkedin.com/in/sahrohit2048</span>
  </footer>
</section>
